  <data name="GizmoSql_LongDescription" errorCode="006" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Returns a navigation table listing the catalogs, schemas, and tables on the GizmoSQL server at &lt;code&gt;server&lt;/code&gt; (e.g. &lt;code&gt;grpc+tls://host:31337&lt;/code&gt;). An optional record parameter, &lt;code&gt;options&lt;/code&gt;, may be specified to control the following options:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;SkipTlsVerification&lt;/code&gt;: When &lt;code&gt;true&lt;/code&gt;, the TLS certificate presented by the server is not validated. Use for servers with self-signed certificates. Defaults to &lt;code&gt;false&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
    </value>
    <comment>{Locked="GizmoSQL"}</comment>
  </data>
